        "id": 23892,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-11-03T12:21:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you are refering to Dawn or Voss, the point is to have them start off with a set of cards in play, but not a specific set.  So, whichever were the first so many to come up will be the random set to start with.  It does state that after playing those cards, all the other nonqualifying cards are to be shuffled back into the deck.</p>",
